{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The king's advisor sends you on an important mission. A sinister magician seeks the power of the black crystal and plans to unleash its dark powers. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many before you have tried to unravel the mystery of the crystal, but none have ever returned!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dangerous, challenging journey takes you to exciting places such as the Witches' Moor, the village in the mist or the eerie palace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore your surroundings very carefully, discover their secrets and solve a variety of quests. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get to know different characters and find lots of hidden objects that will be useful on your journey to confront the magician and his sinister helpers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start an exciting adventure with this fantastic hidden object game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Variety of hidden objects in fantastic hidden object scenes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Tricky puzzles and quests for additional challenges</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3621040?t=1745521598","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3621040?t=1745521598","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621040/b22f895d92e146281472bb55ee1240ce273af14e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745521598","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621040/b22f895d92e146281472bb55ee1240ce273af14e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745521598","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The king's advisor sends you on an important mission. A sinister magician seeks 